          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "3.2 A Tenth Part"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.535,
            0.847,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": "The length of the pencil shown in the figure below is $^ 3 \\frac { 4 } { 1 0 }$ units, which can also be read as 3 units and four one-tenths, i.e., $( 3 \\times 1 ) + \\left( 4 \\times { \\cfrac { 1 } { 1 0 } } \\right)$ units."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.308,
            0.606,
            0.692,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
